## Migrations
- 0023_nidhivan_aiyyo_nidhi: 8 enums, 19 tables, RLS FORCE on all 19,
  REVOKE on immutable tables (bill_approvals INSERT-only,
  ledger_entries append-only), 30+ indexes, deferred FKs
- 0024_vt_n001_dpa_column: vt_n001_dpa_signed / signed_at / reference
  on nidhivan_projects; partial index for compliance dashboard queries
- Archive 0012/0016-0020 migrations (already applied; journal idx gap
  11-12 is non-blocking, DDL exists in DB)

## Libraries
- src/lib/nidhivan/approval-engine.ts: Maker-Checker state machine
  (L1_L2 / L1_L2_L3 / L1_L2_L3_L4 tiers), GST bps arithmetic,
  TDS 194C (100/200 bps), BOQ variation %, SOD invariant enforcement
- src/lib/nidhivan/vantai-gates.ts: VANTAI gates VT-N-001 through
  VT-N-004; VT-N-001 now checks vtN001DpaSigned directly (migration
  0024); composite runPaymentDispatchGates() runner

## API Routes (7)
- GET+POST /api/nidhivan/ra-bills
- GET+PATCH /api/nidhivan/ra-bills/[billId]
- POST /api/nidhivan/ra-bills/[billId]/submit (VT-N-001 gate)
- POST /api/nidhivan/ra-bills/[billId]/approve (VT-N-002+003 on final)
- POST /api/nidhivan/ra-bills/[billId]/reject (SOD + audit trail)
- GET+POST /api/nidhivan/advances (CGST Act S.13(2) advance GST)
- GET+POST /api/nidhivan/vouchers (double-entry invariant, VT-N-004)

## Cockpit
- src/app/nidhivan/cockpit/page.tsx: operational dashboard — KPI strip,
  status distribution, VANTAI gate registry, approval queue table,
  advance tracker with recovery % and GST exposure

## Fortress ATP
- scripts/tc-aiyyo-nidhi-fortress.mjs: TC-AN-001 through TC-AN-013
  covering RLS isolation, paise arithmetic, immutable tables,
  double-entry balance, gate bypass resistance, studio_app role

## Architecture
- ADR-004: all monetary values BIGINT paise; zero DECIMAL/FLOAT
- ADR-006: Anthropic-only for VANTAI-mapped financial/legal/DPDP AI
- ADR-001/002: withTenant() from @/db for all financial DB ops
- SEC-001: no secrets committed; DATABASE_URL rotation P0 OPEN

